# Test Results Summary

## 📊 Test Statistics
- 📊 **Total Tests**: {{report.total}}
- ✅ **Passed**: {{report.passed}}
- ❌ **Failed**: {{report.failed}}
- ⏭️ **Skipped**: {{report.skipped}}
- 🍂 **Flaky Tests**: {{report.flaky}}

## ⏱️ Execution Details
- ⏱️ **Duration**: {{report.duration}}
- 🔍 **Branch**: {{#if github.head_ref}}{{github.head_ref}}{{else}}{{github.ref}}{{/if}}
- 👤 **Triggered by**: {{github.actor}}

{{#unless report.failed}}
No failed tests in this run ✨
{{else}}
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Failed Tests</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {{#each report.failedTests}}
      <tr>
        <td>
          <details>
            <summary>❌ {{this.name}}</summary>
            <pre><code>{{this.message}}</code></pre>
            <p><strong>Trace:</strong></p>
            <pre><code>{{{this.trace}}}</code></pre>
          </details>
        </td>
      </tr>
    {{/each}}
  </tbody>
</table>
{{/unless}}